WEBVTT

01:29.700 --> 01:31.620
[Blood River]

01:31.620 --> 01:33.980
[Based on the novel of the same name from Zhou Munan's Youth in Jianghu series]

01:33.980 --> 01:35.980
[Available on fanqienovel.com & bkneng.com]

01:36.260 --> 01:39.020
[Episode 37]

02:13.850 --> 02:14.500
Move.

02:32.430 --> 02:32.980
Dear.

02:40.030 --> 02:41.130
Are you sure about this?

02:41.910 --> 02:43.450
He might be back soon.

02:44.430 --> 02:44.890
I...

02:46.360 --> 02:47.260
I feel uneasy.

02:54.000 --> 02:54.410
All right.

02:55.470 --> 02:56.290
Then,

02:57.000 --> 02:58.060
I will clear the way for you.

02:59.240 --> 02:59.730
Father,

03:00.280 --> 03:01.220
but your health...

03:03.590 --> 03:04.010
So be it.

03:04.470 --> 03:05.610
If I throw caution to the wind,

03:05.870 --> 03:07.380
then so will you.

03:08.150 --> 03:08.610
Let's go.

03:23.840 --> 03:24.220
Stop.

03:37.430 --> 03:38.410
Come in and talk.

03:54.240 --> 03:54.980
Why did your frost poison

03:56.030 --> 03:57.690
flare this bad all of a sudden?

04:08.590 --> 04:09.170
In there,

04:09.190 --> 04:10.610
did you eat something you shouldn't?

04:13.310 --> 04:14.570
Skywater Cold Tea

04:15.470 --> 04:16.700
and Ice-Month Trio...

04:17.830 --> 04:18.730
They're all

04:19.720 --> 04:20.700
everyday things.

04:21.630 --> 04:23.170
They're common to others,

04:24.000 --> 04:24.930
not to you.

04:27.310 --> 04:28.490
Why insist on having them?

04:33.060 --> 04:35.660
[Thirty years ago]

04:37.240 --> 04:38.050
Ruofeng, how are you?

04:39.360 --> 04:39.930
Brother,

04:42.430 --> 04:43.460
I'm feeling so cold.

04:45.310 --> 04:47.900
Am I dying?

04:48.430 --> 04:49.490
If I die,

04:49.750 --> 04:52.370
I'll see Mother.

04:52.630 --> 04:53.370
Stop the nonsense.

05:03.310 --> 05:04.120
Your hands are like ice.

05:04.360 --> 05:05.220
Tuck them under the quilt.

05:06.240 --> 05:07.410
This quilt is so thin.

05:10.000 --> 05:11.340
Why burn so little charcoal?

05:12.190 --> 05:13.540
If Ruofeng catches cold,

05:14.160 --> 05:14.930
you'll answer for it!

05:16.630 --> 05:17.660
It's this maid's incompetence.

05:18.040 --> 05:19.990
I bribed him with the earrings Her Highness left behind,

05:20.240 --> 05:22.020
so the Household Bureau's junior steward relented.

05:22.390 --> 05:24.050
He said the Noble Consort comes first,

05:24.600 --> 05:25.360
but in three days,

05:25.360 --> 05:26.810
they'll send charcoal to us.

05:27.240 --> 05:29.020
All snobs serving the favored and slight the rest.

05:29.830 --> 05:30.700
Three days won't do.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.330
Ruofeng is young and frail.

05:32.630 --> 05:33.780
He can't wait that long!

05:34.630 --> 05:35.290
Your Highness!

05:36.720 --> 05:37.490
It's freezing outside.

05:37.800 --> 05:39.660
You'll get sick without your cloak.

05:40.870 --> 05:41.460
Your Highness!

05:47.430 --> 05:47.810
This is exactly

05:48.310 --> 05:49.170
what I want!

05:49.720 --> 05:51.610
My brother and I may be out of favor,

05:51.830 --> 05:52.900
but we're still princes!

05:53.920 --> 05:55.290
I want everyone to see

05:55.510 --> 05:56.220
how the Household Bureau

05:56.270 --> 05:57.660
mistreats us!

05:58.600 --> 05:59.100
Let's see

05:59.390 --> 06:00.900
how they answer to my father!

06:02.480 --> 06:03.810
Tomorrow is the Imperial Assembly.

06:04.870 --> 06:06.100
You think those pastries

06:07.390 --> 06:08.460
were specially prepared

06:09.070 --> 06:10.250
by your brother?

06:11.800 --> 06:12.540
Does the answer

06:13.870 --> 06:14.700
matter?

06:15.950 --> 06:16.900
I think

06:18.070 --> 06:19.850
Xiao Yong sent them.

06:22.950 --> 06:23.900
But your brother

06:24.480 --> 06:25.460
surely knew.

06:26.720 --> 06:27.780
He just pretended

06:27.830 --> 06:28.810
not to see.

06:35.600 --> 06:36.290
Jin Xuan.

06:37.950 --> 06:39.810
Your Majesty, your orders?

06:40.510 --> 06:42.170
I've never liked these pastries.

06:43.000 --> 06:43.900
Remove them all.

06:45.120 --> 06:45.660
Also,

06:46.800 --> 06:47.700
tell Yong

06:48.950 --> 06:50.170
not to send them again.

06:51.270 --> 06:51.780
Understood.

06:58.000 --> 06:58.900
I was wondering who it was,

06:59.510 --> 07:01.370
turns out to be the former great eunuchs,

07:02.270 --> 07:03.730
Sir Zhuo Qing's juniors.

07:04.720 --> 07:05.460
Sirs,

07:06.430 --> 07:07.810
since you've entered the imperial tomb,

07:08.510 --> 07:09.860
why return to meddle

07:09.860 --> 07:11.150
in Tianqi City's strife?

07:12.390 --> 07:13.900
Even with your faces veiled,

07:14.560 --> 07:16.540
even if we've never met,

07:17.800 --> 07:19.890
I can still tell by your technique

07:20.040 --> 07:20.850
who you are.

07:21.950 --> 07:22.980
You really think

07:23.600 --> 07:25.700
your deeds can fool the whole world?

07:28.390 --> 07:29.460
And if we can't, so what?

07:30.600 --> 07:32.340
History is written by the winners.

07:33.190 --> 07:34.660
Even if you're the Xueyue Sword Deity,

07:35.270 --> 07:36.810
you're still too young.

07:38.000 --> 07:39.050
With your skill,

07:39.480 --> 07:40.610
can you beat the three of us?

07:42.870 --> 07:44.220
When I draw my sword,

07:45.430 --> 07:46.850
I never weigh the odds!

08:00.390 --> 08:01.810
Su Muyu.

08:02.870 --> 08:03.850
Mu Fusheng.

08:05.560 --> 08:06.730
Su Ziyan.

08:07.480 --> 08:08.540
Xie Piyou.

08:09.600 --> 08:10.610
We meet again.

08:11.870 --> 08:12.900
Master Su,

08:14.600 --> 08:16.810
since we parted at Wanjuan Tower,

08:17.430 --> 08:19.020
you slipped into the jianghu

08:19.390 --> 08:20.490
and found your way.

08:21.310 --> 08:23.700
But staying in Tianqi,

08:24.680 --> 08:27.340
we need to seek a new patron.

08:29.240 --> 08:29.930
In the end,

08:30.310 --> 08:33.130
we chose the First Prince, Xiao Yong.

08:34.030 --> 08:35.010
Never thought

08:35.630 --> 08:36.850
we'd end up

08:37.240 --> 08:39.180
on your opposite side.

08:39.870 --> 08:41.610
Perhaps, Master Su,

08:42.030 --> 08:44.220
you could rechoose your side.

08:45.120 --> 08:45.770
Yes.

08:46.960 --> 08:48.220
Maybe after tonight,

08:48.870 --> 08:50.820
Beili's brightest star, the Prince of Langya,

08:52.080 --> 08:53.180
will fall.

08:54.360 --> 08:55.980
Choose a worthy lord now

08:57.360 --> 08:59.130
so Blood River's men

08:59.910 --> 09:02.300
won't die with you.

09:02.790 --> 09:03.460
A "worthy lord"?

09:05.870 --> 09:07.770
So your "choice"

09:08.870 --> 09:10.370
is to be a servant.

09:11.150 --> 09:12.580
What say you, Master Su?

09:13.630 --> 09:15.650
Blood River belongs to itself.

09:16.600 --> 09:17.820
And I'm not here

09:18.390 --> 09:19.650
for you anyway.

09:21.030 --> 09:22.250
But your lives

09:22.270 --> 09:23.130
end here tonight.

09:23.870 --> 09:25.420
For that choice,

09:26.910 --> 09:28.770
you'll pay the price.

09:34.840 --> 09:35.250
You...

09:41.320 --> 09:41.890
Sir.

09:44.960 --> 09:45.980
Sir Zhuo Qing.

09:48.320 --> 09:50.940
You don't look surprised.

09:51.870 --> 09:53.850
So you came for me.

09:54.670 --> 09:55.370
Master Su,

09:55.960 --> 09:58.250
what do you want?

09:59.030 --> 10:00.490
The Prince of Langya thinks

10:01.440 --> 10:02.530
you left the imperial tomb

10:03.200 --> 10:05.250
with the Dragonseal Scroll.

10:07.750 --> 10:08.890
I'm here tonight

10:10.030 --> 10:12.530
to make sure it stays.

10:15.200 --> 10:16.300
So,

10:17.000 --> 10:19.010
this is your deal with the Prince of Langya?

10:19.390 --> 10:20.940
An assassin of Blood River

10:21.440 --> 10:23.890
helps a great hero

10:24.080 --> 10:27.300
seize a last-dynasty edict of succession.

10:27.870 --> 10:29.770
How ironic.

10:30.840 --> 10:32.170
It does sound

10:32.170 --> 10:34.060
rather ridiculous.

10:36.270 --> 10:37.610
As if...

10:40.030 --> 10:41.130
only those

10:41.150 --> 10:42.980
who stand in the light

10:43.000 --> 10:44.300
would ever do such things.

10:45.080 --> 10:46.530
I do this today

10:47.670 --> 10:49.720
so that it won't look ridiculous

10:49.720 --> 10:51.460
when Blood River does the same

10:52.670 --> 10:54.250
in future!

11:01.030 --> 11:01.850
Master Su,

11:02.790 --> 11:03.980
if I don't

11:04.000 --> 11:05.940
have the scroll?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.340
That doesn't matter.

11:09.150 --> 11:11.250
Tonight, besides the scroll,

11:12.870 --> 11:14.980
you have something else

11:16.120 --> 11:17.650
that must be taken here!

11:18.480 --> 11:19.770
What?

11:20.510 --> 11:21.300
Your life.

11:46.030 --> 11:47.300
You're opening

11:47.360 --> 11:49.100
with the Eighteen-Sword Array!

12:05.870 --> 12:06.340
You guys...

12:06.840 --> 12:07.130
Sir!

12:07.480 --> 12:08.890
It was supposed to be just the two of us,

12:09.320 --> 12:10.100
but they heard the news

12:10.120 --> 12:10.830
and slipped out too.

12:11.150 --> 12:12.030
Not too early, not too late,

12:12.030 --> 12:12.580
just in time!

12:13.120 --> 12:14.010
We broke orders coming here.

12:14.480 --> 12:15.420
Don't blame us, Sir!

12:16.030 --> 12:16.420
Sir!

12:17.150 --> 12:17.940
Fight with no worries!

12:18.320 --> 12:19.300
We've got your back!

12:19.600 --> 12:20.090
Yes!

12:20.200 --> 12:20.980
We've got your back!

12:23.550 --> 12:24.530
What can you possibly do?

12:44.120 --> 12:45.680
The night bell's tolling.

12:45.750 --> 12:46.980
Curfew's on.

12:47.440 --> 12:48.130
Tonight,

12:48.720 --> 12:50.890
no one will disturb this fight.

12:51.480 --> 12:53.180
Vermilion Bird Avenue in Tianqi

12:53.390 --> 12:54.940
shines the brightest.

12:55.510 --> 12:56.530
It's a fitting place

12:56.630 --> 12:58.530
for you to meet your end.

12:59.360 --> 12:59.940
Enough talk!

13:37.270 --> 13:39.730
What a beautiful strike!

13:49.720 --> 13:50.840
I heard

13:50.870 --> 13:52.220
you were once a step

13:52.320 --> 13:54.010
from the Spirit-Roam level.

13:54.670 --> 13:55.180
Yes.

13:56.510 --> 13:58.080
But Mr. Li

13:58.080 --> 13:59.700
smacked my crown,

14:00.000 --> 14:02.100
and I fell into the Grand-Free level.

14:02.440 --> 14:04.010
Even so,

14:04.910 --> 14:07.770
I'm still first in Tianqi.

14:08.240 --> 14:10.300
Only Chancellor Qi Tianchen

14:10.360 --> 14:12.060
is fit to face me.

14:12.600 --> 14:14.850
But for tomorrow's Imperial Assembly,

14:15.270 --> 14:17.890
he's gone to Yuege Terrace outside the city.

14:18.720 --> 14:20.890
My father once told me something.

14:21.550 --> 14:23.700
If it's from the Lord of No-Sword City,

14:25.550 --> 14:27.650
I'll hear it before you die.

14:28.720 --> 14:29.530
Only by beating

14:29.600 --> 14:31.180
someone stronger,

14:32.630 --> 14:33.530
does a fight

14:34.720 --> 14:36.010
mean anything.

14:37.270 --> 14:38.770
Even if it costs you your life,

14:40.630 --> 14:42.180
it still has meaning?

14:42.960 --> 14:44.300
It does.

15:00.200 --> 15:01.370
Who dares touch my daughter!

15:04.360 --> 15:04.940
Dear,

15:06.150 --> 15:07.740
go find the one you love.

15:08.840 --> 15:09.890
These spooks and fiends

15:10.790 --> 15:12.060
won't last a breath

15:12.390 --> 15:13.220
before me!

15:15.630 --> 15:16.220
Father...

15:19.000 --> 15:20.580
There's fight left in this old body yet.

15:23.320 --> 15:23.700
Dear,

15:24.240 --> 15:25.130
I swear

15:25.600 --> 15:26.340
I won't die.

15:26.750 --> 15:27.420
Go on, don't worry.

15:28.600 --> 15:29.250
It's a promise.

15:30.840 --> 15:31.530
It's a promise.

15:36.790 --> 15:37.730
Dear, go now!

16:11.360 --> 16:12.580
So this is

16:13.750 --> 16:15.820
the "meaning" you spoke of?

16:18.150 --> 16:19.100
Yes.

16:19.790 --> 16:21.250
You're way out

16:21.790 --> 16:23.010
of your league.

16:23.600 --> 16:25.370
To kill me,

16:25.480 --> 16:27.420
you're not strong enough.

16:51.240 --> 16:52.300
Humble Heart Technique...

16:53.150 --> 16:54.300
Good.

16:55.910 --> 16:57.060
Su Muyu,

16:58.150 --> 16:59.610
you're good.

17:00.360 --> 17:03.610
Your sword energy is even better.

17:05.400 --> 17:07.220
You want to drain my sword energy

17:07.920 --> 17:09.620
to break through again.

17:10.000 --> 17:11.250
Smart,

17:12.000 --> 17:13.010
Master Su.

17:14.680 --> 17:16.380
If we weren't enemies now,

17:17.270 --> 17:18.050
perhaps

17:19.400 --> 17:21.620
I'd call you a friend.

17:22.790 --> 17:23.770
You and I

17:25.110 --> 17:27.090
will never be friends.

17:29.640 --> 17:32.860
An assassin living in the dark

17:34.550 --> 17:36.940
can still keep your pride?

17:37.510 --> 17:38.940
We dwell in darkness,

17:40.110 --> 17:41.530
but our hearts face the light.

17:43.240 --> 17:45.140
You stand in the light,

17:46.160 --> 17:47.380
yet sink

17:47.510 --> 17:49.330
into your own shadow.

17:56.480 --> 17:57.940
That's just

17:58.070 --> 18:00.220
your wishful thinking.

18:01.270 --> 18:02.180
Your Patriarch

18:02.240 --> 18:04.530
has already cast you aside.

18:05.590 --> 18:06.830
Right now,

18:06.880 --> 18:09.090
he's outside the palace,

18:10.070 --> 18:12.380
moving to cut off the Prince of Langya.

18:13.240 --> 18:14.380
Great Eunuch Zhuo Qing,

18:15.920 --> 18:17.380
do you believe

18:18.790 --> 18:20.660
there's such a thing

18:20.680 --> 18:22.180
as absolute trust?

18:24.550 --> 18:25.900
Between me and Changhe...

18:26.000 --> 18:27.050
Between me and Muyu,

18:27.550 --> 18:29.460
it's absolute trust!

18:42.880 --> 18:46.090
Su Changhe...

18:46.480 --> 18:47.180
It's me,

18:48.680 --> 18:50.220
Blood River's Patriarch,

18:50.920 --> 18:51.810
the Undertaker

18:52.590 --> 18:53.570
to bury you.

18:54.270 --> 18:57.380
So that was your aim.

18:58.510 --> 18:59.620
Su Changhe,

19:00.270 --> 19:02.090
you hid it this long

19:02.750 --> 19:05.940
just to land that palm on me?

19:06.350 --> 19:06.940
Yes.

19:08.480 --> 19:09.940
You're the top fighter

19:09.960 --> 19:10.700
in Tianqi,

19:11.310 --> 19:12.330
once just a step away

19:12.400 --> 19:13.180
from the Spirit-Roam level

19:13.220 --> 19:14.730
above the Sword Deities.

19:15.720 --> 19:17.570
If we don't wound you somehow,

19:18.550 --> 19:19.810
how will we ever stand a chance?

19:20.880 --> 19:22.380
How did you pass

19:22.400 --> 19:24.250
the truth-testing snake's trial?

19:25.920 --> 19:26.730
What I told you that day

19:26.750 --> 19:27.570
wasn't a lie.

19:28.550 --> 19:30.090
Muyu and I chose differently.

19:30.550 --> 19:32.140
He'd ally with the Prince of Langya

19:32.310 --> 19:33.700
to lead Blood River into the light.

19:34.110 --> 19:34.700
As for me,

19:35.720 --> 19:37.330
from the first time I met you,

19:37.350 --> 19:38.570
I had a new idea.

19:39.160 --> 19:40.460
If I'm right,

19:41.030 --> 19:42.050
your Humble Heart Technique,

19:42.400 --> 19:43.570
Ye Dingzhi's Void-Thought Art,

19:43.960 --> 19:45.290
and Blood River's Hell Palm

19:46.000 --> 19:47.810
come from the same manual.

19:49.000 --> 19:49.980
Our inner force

19:50.750 --> 19:51.530
can interlink.

19:52.240 --> 19:53.010
So,

19:53.480 --> 19:54.530
if I can draw out

19:54.530 --> 19:55.700
your Humble Heart power,

19:56.480 --> 19:57.490
I'll become...

19:58.750 --> 20:00.250
invincible.

20:02.920 --> 20:04.250
Arrogant.

20:06.830 --> 20:07.490
Arrogant?

20:09.350 --> 20:10.170
I could feel

20:10.170 --> 20:11.380
that palm I struck

20:12.200 --> 20:13.190
already worked.

20:36.880 --> 20:38.620
That is the ninth level

20:39.270 --> 20:40.620
of the Hell Palm?

20:41.400 --> 20:41.940
My apologies.

20:42.830 --> 20:44.250
Only the ninth.

20:45.110 --> 20:45.700
Today,

20:45.960 --> 20:47.000
I'll feed my palm

20:47.000 --> 20:48.050
with your power.

20:48.680 --> 20:51.090
I'll step to the tenth!

20:53.110 --> 20:54.810
You'd use my strength

20:55.590 --> 20:57.050
to reach the Spirit-Roam level?

20:57.480 --> 20:58.490
Too bad.

20:59.160 --> 21:01.700
Your ninth-level Hell Palm

21:01.720 --> 21:03.250
is a false state.

21:05.160 --> 21:05.660
Yes,

21:06.350 --> 21:07.290
a false state.

21:08.000 --> 21:08.940
So what?

21:09.550 --> 21:10.770
I, Su Changhe,

21:11.240 --> 21:12.090
am hypocritical,

21:12.480 --> 21:13.620
greedy, and cruel.

21:14.590 --> 21:15.290
If it lets me win,

21:15.310 --> 21:16.860
no price is too high.

21:18.350 --> 21:19.700
My Six-Form Hell Palm

21:20.270 --> 21:22.900
will send you into the wheel of rebirth!

22:09.640 --> 22:10.980
That palm

22:11.590 --> 22:12.810
is poisoned?

22:13.240 --> 22:14.410
The venom comes

22:14.410 --> 22:15.620
from the Slumbering Serpent King

22:17.790 --> 22:19.420
of the Yellow Springs Pawnshop.

22:21.070 --> 22:21.730
Zhuo Qing,

22:23.240 --> 22:25.620
from the day I first met you,

22:26.310 --> 22:28.180
I began planning this moment.

22:28.830 --> 22:30.290
I've held back this long,

22:31.200 --> 22:33.220
played along with you all this time,

22:34.720 --> 22:36.180
all just to kill you

22:37.680 --> 22:38.770
here and now.

22:40.270 --> 22:41.810
To kill me?

22:42.550 --> 22:43.140
Of course.

22:45.640 --> 22:47.620
It's been over twenty years

22:48.720 --> 22:50.620
since our first meeting!

23:19.350 --> 23:22.140
When did we meet?

23:22.750 --> 23:23.550
Back in the Miao Territory!

23:25.720 --> 23:27.220
You're...

23:28.350 --> 23:29.730
I was born in Sacred Fire Village.

23:30.920 --> 23:32.770
You were sent there

23:33.720 --> 23:34.490
to seize

23:34.510 --> 23:36.140
our sacred Fire-Dragon Lingzhi.

23:36.790 --> 23:37.810
We refused,

23:38.590 --> 23:40.250
so you slaughtered our entire village.

23:43.160 --> 23:44.420
That day at Wanjuan Tower,

23:45.310 --> 23:46.810
I refused to read the records about me.

23:47.510 --> 23:49.250
Because I had always known

23:49.270 --> 23:50.530
who my enemy was!

23:51.240 --> 23:51.900
Die!

24:20.830 --> 24:21.330
Sir!

24:23.640 --> 24:24.130
Sir!

24:25.470 --> 24:26.180
Sir!

24:31.480 --> 24:32.570
Kill them.

24:36.640 --> 24:37.140
Understood.

25:30.480 --> 25:31.330
You may head back to the Clinic.

25:32.000 --> 25:33.420
Changhe and I will handle this.

25:34.070 --> 25:34.570
Understood!

25:40.200 --> 25:40.730
It's over,

25:41.830 --> 25:42.490
Su Muyu.

25:47.720 --> 25:48.380
Sir...

25:49.110 --> 25:50.570
what are you doing?

26:04.440 --> 26:06.860
Your skills may be weak,

26:09.000 --> 26:10.530
but each of you

26:10.550 --> 26:13.140
still carries decades of inner force.

26:13.400 --> 26:15.860
Since you're doomed to die anyway,

26:16.200 --> 26:18.140
just give me

26:18.270 --> 26:19.530
all your inner force.

26:19.920 --> 26:21.980
Let me touch

26:23.350 --> 26:25.220
the Spirit-Roam level again!

26:33.960 --> 26:35.810
Draining inner force, huh? I can too.

26:37.440 --> 26:38.460
Die!

27:00.350 --> 27:02.010
I've practiced Humble Heart

27:02.070 --> 27:03.380
for years.

27:03.720 --> 27:05.770
I've drained more people

27:05.920 --> 27:07.220
than I can count.

27:08.000 --> 27:09.730
Now you dare try

27:10.070 --> 27:11.810
to drain mine?

27:11.880 --> 27:13.180
Aren't you afraid you'll burst?

27:15.350 --> 27:17.090
Blood River's Undertaker

27:17.160 --> 27:18.810
is famous indeed.

27:19.270 --> 27:20.050
Today,

27:21.160 --> 27:23.490
I'll bury you first...

27:26.310 --> 27:28.980
then kill that Umbrella Ghost!

27:39.200 --> 27:39.770
Su Muyu,

27:40.200 --> 27:40.730
go now.

27:41.310 --> 27:41.980
I'll hold him back!

27:57.200 --> 27:58.570
It's no use.

27:59.440 --> 28:01.380
Humble Heart and Hell Palm

28:01.510 --> 28:02.660
share one source.

28:02.790 --> 28:04.730
Once you start draining,

28:05.200 --> 28:06.900
you can't stop.

28:15.240 --> 28:15.860
Su Muyu!

28:18.030 --> 28:18.730
Don't be reckless.

28:19.590 --> 28:20.220
Go now!

29:19.270 --> 29:19.660
Su Muyu!

29:34.440 --> 29:35.570
Demon Sword...

29:35.790 --> 29:37.410
Why can't the light of this world

29:37.410 --> 29:39.590
make room for Blood River?

29:40.200 --> 29:42.350
No one is born a killer.

29:43.200 --> 29:44.130
We deserve

29:44.130 --> 29:46.050
another chance to choose.

29:50.310 --> 29:51.180
Why do you

29:51.200 --> 29:52.980
block us again and again?

30:03.790 --> 30:04.290
Su Muyu!

30:05.400 --> 30:06.290
That sword art

30:07.160 --> 30:07.940
will cost your life!

30:09.480 --> 30:10.140
Changhe,

30:10.510 --> 30:11.530
if my bloodshed today

30:11.550 --> 30:13.050
can make Blood River run clear

30:13.070 --> 30:14.180
and no longer dim,

30:15.550 --> 30:16.700
then I'll die for it.

30:19.680 --> 30:21.810
At Beili's founding,

30:22.480 --> 30:23.690
Marquis Fengyue

30:23.690 --> 30:25.330
opposed Emperor Tianwu.

30:25.590 --> 30:26.710
The Sword Demon under him

30:26.710 --> 30:28.370
created a sword technique

30:29.000 --> 30:30.900
called the Seven-Slaughter Six-Annihilation Sword!

30:31.550 --> 30:32.090
So be it.

30:34.270 --> 30:35.010
Slay the foe,

30:35.720 --> 30:36.330
slay a friend,

30:37.240 --> 30:38.010
slay immortals,

30:38.270 --> 30:38.940
slay ghosts,

30:39.440 --> 30:40.050
slay the self,

30:40.750 --> 30:41.940
slay all that exists,

30:42.000 --> 30:43.140
slay with no escape,

30:43.790 --> 30:44.810
these are the Seven Slaughters.

30:45.350 --> 30:46.330
Extinguish the Heavenly Way,

30:46.750 --> 30:47.290
the Demonic Way,

30:48.110 --> 30:48.810
the Human Way,

30:48.920 --> 30:49.490
the Ghost Way,

30:50.200 --> 30:51.240
the Asura Way,

30:51.240 --> 30:51.980
the Hell Way,

30:52.510 --> 30:53.460
these are the Six Annihilations.

30:55.720 --> 30:56.660
Zhuo Qing,

30:58.070 --> 30:58.940
choose

30:58.960 --> 31:00.460
your road home!

31:07.160 --> 31:08.250
Your strongest strike

31:10.030 --> 31:11.290
bears your name, Muyu.

31:12.830 --> 31:13.700
Let me see

31:13.750 --> 31:15.010
what your blood rain looks like

31:15.880 --> 31:16.810
once you go demonic.

31:28.510 --> 31:29.250
Fall!

32:03.510 --> 32:04.420
I stopped

32:05.480 --> 32:06.900
that move of yours.

32:07.000 --> 32:07.980
How is this old eunuch

32:09.110 --> 32:10.050
so strong?

32:27.480 --> 32:28.770
Die!

32:55.880 --> 32:56.570
Su Muyu!

32:57.160 --> 32:58.330
I brought your sword.

33:01.510 --> 33:02.010
Crane Feather Sword!

33:18.160 --> 33:19.700
I was born in No-Sword City,

33:21.200 --> 33:22.940
raised with the blade.

33:24.790 --> 33:26.700
I've seen the mightiest strike on earth.

33:27.960 --> 33:29.530
It once avenged

33:29.590 --> 33:30.330
my lost family.

33:32.350 --> 33:34.140
Today, as long as my sword is in hand,

33:35.350 --> 33:36.570
I can carve a future

33:37.480 --> 33:38.980
for my folks,

33:39.830 --> 33:41.180
and for the family I have now!

33:48.460 --> 33:54.140
♪Prejudice like ice, how it hurts to hear♪

33:54.340 --> 33:56.940
♪He clenches his fists♪

33:57.100 --> 34:00.380
♪Fate's rules won't bind me♪

34:00.500 --> 34:08.020
♪Stormwinds lift me straight into the sky♪

34:08.140 --> 34:11.460
♪My heart rides the waves past the river♪

34:11.620 --> 34:21.340
♪Dust on my boots, home at last♪

34:21.380 --> 34:30.100
♪I won't ask, won't answer, just a humble soul♪

34:30.180 --> 34:34.620
♪This drink I offer to the brave of every shore...♪

34:37.030 --> 34:39.460
You're about to go demonic.

34:40.510 --> 34:42.090
Even if you beat me,

34:43.960 --> 34:46.420
you won't escape death.

34:49.960 --> 34:51.490
You may be unmatched,

34:53.150 --> 34:54.820
but I've got people behind me!

34:54.820 --> 34:56.780
♪As dawn breaks in the east, I rise by my own strength♪

34:56.820 --> 35:02.300
♪The road beneath my feet, I leave my prints in mud♪

35:02.540 --> 35:05.060
♪The earth gives life, asking nothing in return♪

35:05.180 --> 35:11.900
♪We cross the dark river with a leap of faith♪

35:54.960 --> 35:56.300
After that strike,

35:59.480 --> 36:00.860
Muyu's fully gone demonic.

36:01.280 --> 36:02.020
Su Muyu!

36:02.800 --> 36:03.570
Miss Bai, watch out!

36:06.960 --> 36:07.610
Su Muyu...

36:14.510 --> 36:15.380
This is Iceheart Water.

36:15.880 --> 36:17.090
It stops the demonic backlash.

36:59.300 --> 37:05.820
♪Life hangs by the blade. What path is there for me to choose?♪

37:05.820 --> 37:11.980
♪Bound by fate, I draw my blade again♪

37:12.060 --> 37:14.900
♪Rain drifts on steel at dusk...♪

37:16.000 --> 37:16.740
Great.

37:19.140 --> 37:25.860
♪Dust rises, I walk toward the light♪

37:25.860 --> 37:32.780
♪Even alone through storm and snow...♪

37:32.920 --> 37:33.530
Hehuai...

37:36.150 --> 37:37.170
It's over.

37:39.440 --> 37:40.130
Finally, we can...

37:42.320 --> 37:43.130
go back to Nan'an.

37:47.280 --> 37:47.860
All right.

37:49.760 --> 37:50.340
Nan'an.

37:52.000 --> 37:52.530
Nan'an.

37:54.760 --> 37:55.340
Nan'an.

37:57.360 --> 37:57.980
Nan'an.

38:00.380 --> 38:06.940
♪I seek justice, and guard the world's peace...♪

38:07.190 --> 38:07.820
Su Muyu,

38:08.840 --> 38:09.570
I was wrong.

38:10.150 --> 38:11.080
Just like me,

38:11.280 --> 38:13.010
you're one of the finest men!

38:23.320 --> 38:23.860
Miss Bai,

38:24.960 --> 38:25.570
what's wrong?

38:38.110 --> 38:38.490
I...

38:41.280 --> 38:42.780
I fell for my martial niece's trap.

38:46.320 --> 38:47.300
What exactly happened?

38:48.960 --> 38:50.050
I was still not fully healed,

38:50.760 --> 38:52.170
then burned my essence blood

38:52.920 --> 38:53.610
to refine the antidote.

38:54.190 --> 38:54.900
So,

38:55.440 --> 38:57.090
the puppet poison in me

38:57.150 --> 38:58.300
that Baicao should've purged

38:59.440 --> 39:00.490
has now flared up again.

39:01.230 --> 39:02.460
It must have been a trap

39:04.000 --> 39:05.010
set by Night Crow.

39:17.550 --> 39:18.050
Dear,

39:18.760 --> 39:20.460
isn't there a cure for puppet poison?

39:22.550 --> 39:23.530
It's brewed...

39:24.840 --> 39:25.650
with my blood...

39:26.590 --> 39:27.860
How would it cure my own toxin?

39:32.440 --> 39:33.090
Su Muyu...

39:34.150 --> 39:34.610
I'm here.

39:38.440 --> 39:39.210
Kill me.

39:40.440 --> 39:41.010
Su Muyu,

39:41.480 --> 39:42.260
kill me!

39:49.190 --> 39:50.460
I don't want to be a puppet.

39:51.670 --> 39:52.650
It'd look monstrous.

39:54.880 --> 39:55.780
You won't die.

39:56.960 --> 39:57.900
We'll find a way.

39:58.030 --> 39:58.900
Su Muyu,

39:59.280 --> 40:00.170
there's no time.

40:00.760 --> 40:01.460
This time,

40:01.670 --> 40:03.170
no remedy will work.

40:04.030 --> 40:04.980
Su Muyu,

40:05.590 --> 40:07.010
it's really too late.

40:09.360 --> 40:09.980
I'm sorry.

40:12.110 --> 40:12.650
I...

40:14.920 --> 40:16.210
I can't make it back to Nan'an.

40:16.710 --> 40:17.260
Su Muyu,

40:17.630 --> 40:18.260
Su Changhe,

40:18.550 --> 40:19.490
let's join our inner force

40:19.760 --> 40:20.780
and drive her poison out!

40:21.400 --> 40:22.130
It's no use.

40:23.030 --> 40:24.380
Inner force can't purge this toxin.

40:25.280 --> 40:25.740
Dear,

40:26.280 --> 40:26.900
with me here,

40:26.960 --> 40:27.690
you'll be fine!

40:34.360 --> 40:34.900
Miss Bai!

40:38.760 --> 40:40.010
There's a miracle physician in Tianqi City too.

40:40.760 --> 40:41.610
Tu Wan once told me.

40:42.360 --> 40:43.210
I know where he is.

40:43.920 --> 40:44.570
I'll take her there.

41:13.150 --> 41:14.820
Never thought Tang Lianyue

41:16.030 --> 41:18.050
was that strong...

41:19.000 --> 41:21.130
He cost me my bodyguard puppet

41:21.190 --> 41:22.380
and I had to fake death to escape.

41:24.800 --> 41:26.300
One of Tianqi's Four Guardians.

41:27.400 --> 41:28.860
I really underestimated him.

41:35.190 --> 41:35.860
But...

41:36.710 --> 41:38.090
none of that matters now.

41:39.760 --> 41:41.690
After brewing so many antidotes,

41:42.840 --> 41:43.780
Martial Aunt

41:44.510 --> 41:46.860
should be feeling the backlash now.

41:54.540 --> 41:55.780
[Healing Hands]

42:22.820 --> 42:26.300
♪Like fate, winding with the tide♪

42:26.340 --> 42:30.220
♪Who can ford this river of night?♪

42:32.060 --> 42:35.540
♪Where's the far shore we chase all our lives?♪

42:35.580 --> 42:39.420
♪Surrendering all hues for a glimmer of light♪

42:41.420 --> 42:44.700
♪Through joy and sorrow♪

42:44.820 --> 42:46.900
♪Still I can't let go♪

42:47.060 --> 42:50.500
♪Longing keeps me awake at night♪

42:50.980 --> 42:53.180
♪My heart no longer my own♪

42:53.300 --> 42:58.300
♪No one can escape from love♪

43:14.900 --> 43:18.620
♪How many hidden feelings♪

43:18.740 --> 43:22.820
♪Sink in silence deep?♪

43:24.060 --> 43:27.940
♪Searching through the endless nights♪

43:28.060 --> 43:32.300
♪Struggling on the edge of love and pain♪

43:33.420 --> 43:36.300
♪Shadows crossing shadows♪

43:36.380 --> 43:40.620
♪Whose name hides in your eyes?♪

43:42.900 --> 43:46.900
♪When the wind blows, ask not when I shall return♪

43:46.940 --> 43:50.380
♪Ask not when I shall return♪

43:51.900 --> 43:55.340
